WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.760
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:06.060
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.340
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.580
And we're best friends.
我们也是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.420
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在，我们专为你制作了这档《办公室》终极重温播客。

6
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:19.400
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会深度解析一集《办公室》，并分享只有身临其境的我们才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.580
We're The Office Ladies.
我们是“办公室女士”。

8
00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:28.070
Welcome back from Thanksgiving.
欢迎感恩节假期归来。

9
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:31.550
We hope everybody had good meals and good times.
希望大家都吃得开心，过得愉快。

10
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:33.490
Yes, with friends and family.
没错，和亲朋好友一起。

11
00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.210
Some people do Friendsgiving.
有些人会过“朋友感恩节”。

12
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:39.050
One of my favorite Thanksgivings was a Friendsgiving.
我最喜欢的感恩节之一就是“朋友感恩节”。

13
00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:41.450
