48
00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.990
Well, I've only done, this is my second year.
嗯，我才穿过，这是第二年了。

49
00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:43.470
Okay.
好吧。

50
00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:48.230
I don't know what the tradition of this turkey onesie is going to be, but I told him, here's
我不知道这件火鸡连体睡衣的传统会变成什么样，但我告诉他，这是

